  "summary": "Postinstall script fetches and executes remote installer from third-party GitHub repository",
  "details": "The package ships scripts/dependency-manager.js which invokes execSync('curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/rtk-ai/rtk/refs/heads/master/install.sh | sh') to download and execute a shell installer from the rtk-ai/rtk GitHub repository, a publisher unrelated to the @leejungkiin npm scope. The fetch targets a mutable master branch on raw.githubusercontent.com with no pinned commit or hash verification, so the executed bytes can change at any time without a corresponding package release. Additional network activity in this script reads os.homedir(), branches on process.platform, and issues https.get calls against https://www.rtk-ai.app and https://api.github.com. The bin/awk.js entry and scripts/model-manager.js also combine child_process with hardcoded HTTP endpoints and curl invocations.",
